{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1365883964"}, "name":{"label":"Ncodkdldkd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-20T04:38:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.21.0"}, "id":{"label":"14204902834"}, "title":{"label":"欺骗"}, "content":{"label":"我预订的是7位成人入住的房间，到了酒店却被安排成3间单人房，与预订需求不符。联系客服后被转到 WhatsApp，但在 WhatsApp 上也没有人提供帮助。体验非常差，建议大家通过 Agoda 预订时多加注意。\n\nTiếng Anh:\nI booked accommodation for 7 adults, but upon arrival I was assigned 3 single rooms, which did not match my booking requirements. When I contacted customer support, I was redirected to WhatsApp, but no one provided assistance there. Very disappointing experience. I would advise others booking through Agoda to be cautious.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
